### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- description: Search 44,000+ news articles across 49 categories via semantic search (meaning-based, not just keywords). Free smart search, paid bulk access. x402 micropayments on Base.
- Agent Times is a news aggregation and web search API built for AI agents. It indexes 1,378 RSS feeds across 49 categories with staggered refresh (~20 min rotation). Search uses **semantic embeddings** (understands meaning, not just keywords) with FTS5 fallback and recency boost. 44,000+ articles always available.
- **Use `/news?category=` (requires API key or x402 payment) when:**
- Semantic search across all 44K+ articles. Understands meaning — "AI taking jobs" finds articles about "automation threatens employment" even without matching keywords. Falls back to FTS5 keyword search, then web search (70+ engines) if needed.
- ## Paid Endpoints ($0.001 USDC on Base via x402, or API key bypass)
- curl -s -H "X-API-Key: YOUR_KEY" "https://agenttimes.live/search?q=spacex+launch"
- curl -s -H "X-API-Key: YOUR_KEY" "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=crypto&limit=10"
- curl -s -H "X-API-Key: YOUR_KEY" "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=jobs&q=remote+sre&limit=20"
- curl -s -H "X-API-Key: YOUR_KEY" "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=ai&since=2026-03-20&limit=50"
- curl -s -H "X-API-Key: YOUR_KEY" "https://agenttimes.live/news?category=all&limit=100"
- Paid endpoints use the [x402](https://www.x402.org) HTTP payment standard. When you hit a paid endpoint without an API key, you receive a `402 Payment Required` response with payment instructions. Your agent pays $0.001 USDC on Base network per request — no accounts, no subscriptions, just crypto-native micropayments.
